  "liveries.GC.branding": "The winged Grand Central emblem over 'GRAND CENTRAL' and 'by arriva', between door 1 and the first window: Maxey (2024-11) 1D projective fit on seven window edges: 5.28-6.57 m along; heights against the windows' 2.20-2.91 at the same column (162 px/m up): 2.17-2.76. Traced off the same photo (logos/GC-bodyside.svg: 113 px wide in the source, so the letters are soft); stretched to the measured width (the photo foreshortens it to aspect 1.0, the panel is 2.2). 'by arriva' is red on the train, cream here (one ink)."
